"něhdźe 18 MB."

msgid ""
"The attachments in this note are too large together. Remove some files; the "
"combined limit is approximately 18 MB."
msgstr ""
"Přiwěški w tutej noticy su hromadźe přewulke. Wotstrońće někotre dataje; "
"zhromadny limit je něhdźe 18 MB."

msgid ""
"The background reminder service cannot read the encrypted data and remains "
"silent outside the open organizer."
msgstr ""
"Słužba dopominanjow w pozadku njemóže zaklučowane daty čitać a zwonka "
"wočinjenego organizatora mjelči."

msgid ""
"The background reminder service may read the separate reminder data and "
"therefore works even when the organizer is closed."
msgstr ""
"Słužba dopominanjow w pozadku smě wotdźělene daty dopominanjow čitać a "
"funguje tuž tež při začinjenym organizatorje."

msgid "The backup could not be created."
msgstr "Zawěsćenje njehodźeše so załožić."

msgid "The backup could not be read."
msgstr "Zawěsćenje njehodźeše so čitać."

msgid "The backup could not be restored."
msgstr "Zawěsćenje njehodźeše so wobnowić."

msgid "The backup does not contain a complete data set."
msgstr "Zawěsćenje dospołnu datowu sadźbu njewobsahuje."

msgid "The backup does not contain readable organizer data."
msgstr "Zawěsćenje čitajomne daty organizatora njewobsahuje."

msgid "The backup file is larger than 256 megabytes."
msgstr "Zawěsćenski dataj je wjetši hač 256 megabajtow."

msgid "The backup file was not found."
msgstr "Zawěsćenski dataj njeje so namakał."

msgid ""
"The backup will be stored outside the local data location and is therefore "
"always encrypted. This password will be required to restore it later:\n"
"%(path)s"
msgstr ""
"Zawěsćenje so zwonka lokalneho datoweho městna składuje a je tuž přeco "
"zaklučowane. Tute hesło budźe pozdźišo za wobnowjenje trěbne:\n"
"%(path)s"

msgid ""
"The button in the bottom bar opens the selection for the section you have "
"open. From there the ticked entries can be printed, exported or moved to the "
"wastebasket."
msgstr ""
"Tłóčatko w delnim pasu wočini wuběr za wočinjeny wotrězk. Wottam hodźa so "
"wotškrtnjene zapiski ćišćeć, eksportować abo do papjeroweho koša přesunyć."

msgid "The clipboard is empty."
msgstr "Mjezyskład je prózdny."

msgid "The communication method is incomplete."
msgstr "Komunikaciska metoda njeje dospołna."

msgid "The complete file is stored in this note (up to 8 megabytes)."
msgstr "Cyły dataj je w tutej noticy składowany (hač do 8 megabajtow)."

msgid "The contact synchronization message is invalid."
msgstr "Powěsć synchronizacije kontaktow je njepłaćiwa."

msgid "The contact synchronization setting is invalid."
msgstr "Nastajenje synchronizacije kontaktow je njepłaćiwe."

msgid "The content is unreadable."
msgstr "Wobsah njeje čitajomny."

msgid ""
"The current data will be backed up first and then completely replaced with "
"this file:\n"
"%(path)s"
msgstr ""
"Aktualne daty so najprjedy zawěsća a potom dospołnje z tutym datajom "
"naruna:\n"
"%(path)s"

msgid "The current organizer data is incomplete."
msgstr "Aktualne daty organizatora njejsu dospołne."

msgid "The custom application command is invalid."
msgstr "Swójski nałoženski přikaz je njepłaćiwy."

msgid "The custom application could not be started."
msgstr "Swójske nałoženje njehodźeše so startować."

msgid "The custom application was not found."
msgstr "Swójske nałoženje njeje so namakało."

msgid "The custom website is not a secure HTTPS address."
msgstr "Swójska webstrona njeje wěsta HTTPS-adresa."

msgid "The data changed during password transaction recovery."
msgstr "Daty su so při wobnowjenju hesłoweje transakcije změnili."

msgid ""
"The data is encrypted – background reminders have not been enabled under "
"Settings > Security."
msgstr ""
"Daty su zaklučowane – dopominanja w pozadku njejsu pod Nastajenja > Wěstota "
"zmóžnjene."

msgid ""
"The data is encrypted – the enabled, limited reminder data is being used."
msgstr ""
"Daty su zaklučowane – zmóžnjene wobmjezowane dopominanske daty so wužiwaja."

msgid "The data is encrypted. Unlock the organizer with the password first."
msgstr "Daty su zaklučowane. Wotzamkńće najprjedy organizator z hesłom."

msgid "The data is not a JSON object."
msgstr "Daty njejsu JSON-objekt."

msgid "The data is still encrypted. Try again."
msgstr "Daty su hišće zaklučowane. Spytajće znowa."

msgid "The data key is not available."
msgstr "Datowy kluč k dispoziciji njeje."

msgid ""
"The directory containing the interface (/usr/share/magnolie-organizer/web) "
"was not found."
msgstr ""
"Zapis z powjerchom (/usr/share/magnolie-organizer/web) njeje so namakał."

msgid "The encrypted Magnolienbaum identity is damaged."
msgstr "Zaklučowana identita Magnolienbaum je wobškodźena."

msgid "The encrypted Magnolienbaum storage is damaged."
msgstr "Zaklučowany składowak Magnolienbaum je wobškodźeny."

msgid "The encrypted backup requires python3-cryptography."
msgstr "Zaklučowane zawěsćenje sej python3-cryptography žada."

msgid "The encrypted file is damaged."
msgstr "Zaklučowany dataj je wobškodźeny."

msgid "The end date cannot be before the start date."
msgstr "Kónčny datum njemóže před startowym datumom być."

msgid "The entered fingerprint is incomplete."
msgstr "Zapodaty porstowy wotćišć njeje dospołny."

msgid "The file could not be read."
msgstr "Dataj njehodźeše so čitać."

#, python-format
msgid "The file could not be written (%s)."
msgstr "Dataj njehodźeše so pisać (%s)."

msgid "The file has an unsupported format."
msgstr "Dataj ma njepodpěrany format."

msgid "The file is larger than 8 megabytes."
msgstr "Dataj je wjetši hač 8 megabajtow."

#, python-format
msgid "The fingerprint does not match (received: %(fingerprint)s)."
msgstr "Porstowy wotćišć so njekryje (dóstane: %(fingerprint)s)."

msgid ""
"The helper frame marks the control that currently has keyboard focus. This "
"makes it easier to operate the Organizer with Tab, arrow keys, Enter and "
"Space. Ctrl+Alt+H switches the frame on or off at any time."
msgstr ""
"Pomocny wobłuk markěruje wodźidło, kotrež ma runje tastaturowy fokus. To "
"wolóži wobchadźenje Organizatora z Tab, šipkami, Enter a prózdnotastej. "
"Ctrl+Alt+H wobłuk kóždy čas zaswěći abo zhasnje."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The holiday service is unavailable. Is there an internet connection? (%s)"
msgstr "Słužba swjatych dnjow k dispoziciji njeje. Je internetny zwisk? (%s)"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The holiday service rejected the request (error %s). Check the country and "
"region."
msgstr ""
"Słužba swjatych dnjow naprašowanje wotpokaza (zmylk %s). Přepruwujće kraj a "
"region."

msgid "The holiday service returned an unreadable response."
msgstr "Słužba swjatych dnjow je nječitajomnu wotmołwu wróćiła."

msgid "The holiday service returned too much data."
msgstr "Słužba swjatych dnjow je přewjele datow wróćiła."

msgid "The holidays were imported."
msgstr "Swjate dny su so importowali."

msgid "The holidays were removed."
msgstr "Swjate dny su so wotstronili."

msgid "The import file is larger than 32 megabytes."
msgstr "Importowy dataj je wjetši hač 32 megabajtow."

msgid ""
"The information is retrieved once from the open directory openholidaysapi."
"org and then kept in the organizer. The application therefore needs an "
"internet connection only once."
msgstr ""
"Informacije so jónu z wotewrjeneho zapisa openholidaysapi.org wotwołaja a "
"potom w organizatorje wobchowaja. Nałoženje tuž internetny zwisk jenož jónu "
"trjeba."

msgid "The internet service did not return a valid IP address."
msgstr "Internetowa słužba njeje płaćiwu IP-adresu wróćiła."

msgid ""
"The key of this branch has changed. Remove the old connection first and "
"compare the new fingerprint particularly carefully."
msgstr ""
"Kluč tutoho hałuza je so změnił. Wotstrońće najprjedy stary zwisk a "
"přirunajće nowy porstowy wotćišć wosebje kedźbliwje."

msgid "The last notebook cannot be deleted."
msgstr "Posledni noticnik njehodźi so zhašeć."

msgid "The last notebook group cannot be deleted."
msgstr "Poslednja skupina noticnikow njehodźi so zhašeć."

msgid "The log could not be opened."
msgstr "Protokol njehodźeše so wočinić."

msgid "The log is available only in the installed application."
msgstr "Protokol je jenož w instalowanym nałoženju k dispoziciji."

msgid ""
"The log records when the reminder service checked and what it reported. "
"Entries older than 30 days are removed automatically, and the log never "
"exceeds 200 lines."
msgstr ""
"Protokol registruje, hdy je słužba dopominanjow kontrolowała a što je "
"zdźěliła. Zapiski starše hač 30 dnjow so awtomatisce wotstronja a protokol "
"nima ženje wjace hač 200 linkow."

msgid "The manual"
msgstr "Přiručka"

msgid "The manual could not be opened."
msgstr "Přiručka njehodźeše so wočinić."

msgid "The manual download is available only in the installed application."
msgstr "Sćehnjenje přiručki je jenož w instalowanym nałoženju k dispoziciji."

msgid "The manual download request is no longer valid."
msgstr "Manuelne naprašowanje za downloadom njeje wjace płaćiwe."

msgid "The manual is installed; its version is unknown."
msgstr "Přiručka je instalowana; Jeho wersija njeje znata."

msgid "The manual is up to date."
msgstr "Přiručka je na najnowšim stawje."

msgid "The manual package URL is not allowed."
msgstr "URL paketa přiručki njeje dowoleny."

msgid "The manual package checksum does not match."
msgstr "Ručna kontrolna suma pakćika so njekryje."

msgid "The manual package could not be opened."
msgstr "Paket přiručki njehodźeše so wočinić."

msgid "The manual package is unexpectedly large."
msgstr "Ručny pakćik je njewočakowano wulki."

msgid "The manual update check failed."
msgstr "Manuelna kontrola aktualizacije njeje so radźiła."

msgid "The manual update information is invalid."
msgstr "Manuelne aktualizowanske informacije su njepłaćiwe."

msgid "The maximum number of branches has been reached."
msgstr "Maksimalna ličba hałuzow je docpěta."

msgid "The message comes from another branch."
msgstr "Powěsć přińdźe z druheho hałuza."

msgid "The message could not be opened."
msgstr "Powěsć njehodźeše so wočinić."

msgid "The message is damaged."
msgstr "Powěsć je wobškodźena."

msgid "The message is too large."
msgstr "Powěsć je přewulka."

msgid "The month is invalid."
msgstr "Měsac je njepłaćiwy."

msgid "The offered entry is incomplete."
msgstr "Poskićeny zapisk njeje dospołny."

msgid "The organizer is not currently reminding you about appointments."
msgstr "Organizator was runje na terminy njedopomina."

msgid ""
"The organizer notifies you before an appointment begins, even when the "
"application is not open if you wish."
msgstr ""
"Organizator was před započatkom termina informuje a, jeli chceće, tež hdyž "
"nałoženje wočinjene njeje."

msgid "The other branch did not prove the pairing file."
msgstr "Druhi hałuz njeje porowanski dataj wobkrućił."

msgid "The other branch did not send a valid key."
msgstr "Druhi hałuz njeje płaćiwy kluč pósłał."

#, python-format
msgid "The other branch is not responding (%(error)s)."
msgstr "Druhi hałuz njewotmołwja (%(error)s)."

msgid "The package URL is not allowed."
msgstr "URL paketa njeje dowoleny."

msgid "The package could not be opened."
msgstr "Paket njehodźeše so wočinić."

msgid "The pairing file could not be processed."
msgstr "Porowanski dataj njehodźeše so předźěłać."

msgid "The pairing file has been changed."
msgstr "Porowanski dataj je so změnił."

msgid "The pairing file is damaged."
msgstr "Porowanski dataj je wobškodźeny."

msgid "The pairing file is invalid or has expired."
msgstr "Porowanski dataj je njepłaćiwy abo je jeho płaćiwosć zańdźena."

msgid "The pairing file is no longer valid."
msgstr "Porowanski dataj hižo njepłaći."

msgid "The pairing file is too large or not a regular file."
msgstr "Porowanski dataj je přewulki abo njeje regularny dataj."

msgid "The pairing file is too large."
msgstr "Porowanski dataj je přewulki."

msgid "The pairing request is incomplete."
msgstr "Porowanske naprašowanje njeje dospołne."

msgid "The pairing request is invalid."
msgstr "Porowanske naprašowanje je njepłaćiwe."

msgid "The password is incorrect."
msgstr "Hesło je wopak."

msgid "The password transaction could not be completed."
msgstr "Hesłowa transakcija njehodźeše so dokónčić."

msgid "The password transaction journal is damaged."
msgstr "Žurnal hesłoweje transakcije je wobškodźeny."

msgid "The phone connection is available only in the installed application."
msgstr "Wuběr rjadowaka je jenož w instalowanym nałoženju k dispoziciji."

msgid "The phone connection is not available."
msgstr "Magnolienbaum k dispoziciji njeje."

msgid "The photo could not be read."
msgstr "Foto njehodźeše so čitać."

msgid "The photo is larger than 8 megabytes."
msgstr "Foto je wjetše hač 8 megabajtow."

msgid "The planner layout is invalid."
msgstr "Wuhotowanje planowaka je njepłaćiwe."

msgid "The port is invalid."
msgstr "Port je njepłaćiwy."

msgid "The previous data could not be backed up."
msgstr "Předchadne daty njehodźachu so zawěsćić."

#, python-format
msgid "The print page is located at: %s"
msgstr "Ćišćenska strona je tu: %s"

#, python-format
msgid "The public address could not be determined (%(error)s)."
msgstr "Zjawna adresa njehodźeše so zwěsćić (%(error)s)."

msgid "The public address could not be determined."
msgstr "Zjawna adresa njehodźeše so zwěsćić."

msgid "The public key is invalid."
msgstr "Zjawny kluč je njepłaćiwy."

msgid "The recovery snapshot folder must not be a symbolic link."
msgstr "Wuchowanski snapshotowy rjadowak njesmě žadyn symboliski zwisk być."

msgid "The recovery snapshot is missing or damaged."
msgstr "Wuchowanski wobraz faluje abo je wobškodźeny."

msgid "The recovery snapshot manifest is invalid."
msgstr "Manifest snapshota wočerstwjenja je njepłaćiwy."

msgid "The recovery snapshot manifest is too large."
msgstr "Wustrowjenski wobrazowy manifest je přewulki."

msgid "The recovery snapshot payload does not match its manifest."
msgstr "Wuchowanski snapshot wužitny dźěl njewotpowěduje swojemu manifestej."

msgid "The recovery snapshot was not found."
msgstr "Wustrowjenski wobraz njebu namakany."

msgid "The recycle bin is empty."
msgstr "Papjerowy koš je prózdny."

msgid "The recycle bin was emptied."
msgstr "Papjerowy koš je so wuprózdnił."

msgid "The request is unreadable."
msgstr "Naprašowanje njeje čitajomne."

msgid "The required recovery snapshot could not be created."
msgstr "Trěbny wotnowjenski wobraz njemóžeše so wutworić."

msgid "The response is too large."
msgstr "Wotmołwa je přewulka."

msgid ""
"The same code must appear on both computers:\n"
"\n"
"%(code)s\n"
"\n"
"Other branch: %(branch)s\n"
"Fingerprint: %(fingerprint)s\n"
"\n"
"Does the code match?"
msgstr ""
"Na woběmaj ličakomaj dyrbi samsny kod być:\n"
"\n"
"%(code)s\n"
"\n"
"Druhi hałuz: %(branch)s\n"
"Porstowy wotćišć: %(fingerprint)s\n"
"\n"
"Kryje so kod?"

msgid "The save request is invalid."
msgstr "Składowanske naprašowanje je njepłaćiwe."

msgid "The secure interface could not be registered."
msgstr "Wěsty powjerch njehodźeše so registrować."

msgid "The secure message could not be opened."
msgstr "Wěsta powěsć njehodźeše so wočinić."

msgid "The secure message is invalid."
msgstr "Wěsta powěsć je njepłaćiwa."

msgid "The secure session has already been used."
msgstr "Wěste posedźenje je hižo so wužiło."

msgid "The secure session is damaged."
msgstr "Wěste posedźenje je wobškodźene."

msgid "The secure session is unknown or expired."
msgstr "Wěste posedźenje njeje znate abo je zańdźene."

msgid "The secure session request is invalid."
msgstr "Naprašowanje wěsteho posedźenja je njepłaćiwe."

msgid "The secure session response is invalid."
msgstr "Wotmołwa wěsteho posedźenja je njepłaćiwa."

msgid "The selected contacts contain no values for these columns."
msgstr "Wubrane kontakty za tute stołpiki žane hódnoty njewobsahuja."

msgid "The selected file is not a readable CSV file."
msgstr "Wubrany dataj njeje čitajomny CSV-dataj."

msgid "The selected file is not a readable iCalendar file."
msgstr "Wubrany dataj njeje čitajomny iCalendar-dataj."

msgid "The selected health records contain no printable values."
msgstr "Wubrane strowotne zapiski žane ćišćomne hódnoty njewobsahuja."

msgid "The selected iCalendar file is incomplete."
msgstr "Wubrany iCalendar-dataj njeje dospołny."

msgid "The selected path is not a regular file."
msgstr "Wubrana šćežka njeje regularny dataj."

msgid "The selected source was not found. Select it again in Settings."
msgstr "Wubrane žórło njeje so namakało. Wubjerće jo w Nastajenjach znowa."

msgid "The service returned no entries for this selection."
msgstr "Słužba za tutón wuběr žane zapiski njewróći."

msgid ""
"The sheet appears at the edge of the screen, accompanied by the Magnolie "
"chime."
msgstr "Łopjeno so na kromje wobrazowki zjewi, zhromadnje ze zynkom Magnolie."

msgid ""
"The small uniform icons open an installed application when possible. "
"Otherwise, a secure web service is used in the browser."
msgstr ""
"Małe jednore ikony wočinja instalowane nałoženje, jeli je to móžno. Hewak so "
"wěsta websłužba we wobhladowaku wužiwa."

msgid "The snapshot operation failed."
msgstr "Operacija momentoweho wobraza zwrěšći."

msgid "The start date must not be after the end date."
msgstr "Startowy datum njesmě za kónčnym datumom być."

msgid "The task is missing from the update."
msgstr "Nadawk w aktualizaciji faluje."

msgid ""
"The task will be sent to the selected branch. It will also remain here so "
"you can keep track of it."
msgstr ""
"Nadawk so wubranemu hałuzej pósćele. Wostanje tež tu, zo byšće móhli jeho "
"staw wobkedźbować."

msgid ""
"The traffic-light colors are general reference ranges for adults, not a "
"diagnosis. Check abnormal readings and discuss them with a doctor; seek "
"immediate medical help for severe symptoms."
msgstr ""
"Ampelfarby su powšitkowne referencne wobłuki za dorosćenych, nic diagnoza. "
"Přepruwujće anomalne měrjenske hódnoty a wobjednajće je z lěkarjom; při "
"ćežkich symptomach pytajće hnydom medicinsku pomoc."

#, python-format
msgid "The tray applet could not be started: %s"
msgstr "Aplet systemoweho pola njehodźeše so startować: %s"

msgid "The tray applet is not available on this system."
msgstr "Aplet systemoweho pola na tutym systemje k dispoziciji njeje."

msgid ""
"The tray applet requires Ayatana AppIndicator. On plain GNOME, the "
"AppIndicator extension is also required."
msgstr ""
"Aplet systemoweho pola trjeba Ayatana AppIndicator. Na čistem GNOME je tež "
"rozšěrjenje AppIndicator trěbne."

msgid "The trust setting is invalid."
msgstr "The trust setting is invalid."

msgid "The two entries do not match."
msgstr "Wobaj zapiskaj so njekryjetej."

msgid "The two new passwords do not match."
msgstr "Wobě nowe hesle so njekryjetej."

msgid "The update check failed."
msgstr "Kontrola aktualizacijow njeje so poradźiła."

msgid "The update information does not contain a valid package checksum."
msgstr ""
"Informacija wo aktualizaciji płaćiwu kontrolnu sumu paketa njewobsahuje."

msgid "The update information does not contain a valid version."
msgstr "Informacija wo aktualizaciji płaćiwu wersiju njewobsahuje."

msgid "The update information does not refer to an allowed package URL."
msgstr "Informacija wo aktualizaciji so na dowoleny URL paketa njepoćahuje."

msgid "The update information has an invalid signature."
msgstr "Informacija wo aktualizaciji ma njepłaćiwu signaturu."

#, python-format
msgid "The update information is currently unavailable (%s)."
msgstr "Informacija wo aktualizaciji tuchwilu k dispoziciji njeje (%s)."

msgid "The update information is unexpectedly large."
msgstr "Informacija wo aktualizaciji je njewočakowanje wulka."

msgid "The update information is unreadable."
msgstr "Informacija wo aktualizaciji njeje čitajomna."

msgid "The user data could not be read."
msgstr "Wužiwarske daty njehodźachu so čitać."

msgid "The value is outside the general green reference range."
msgstr "Hódnota je zwonka powšitkowneho zeleneho referencneho wobłuka."

msgid "The wake-up reminder"
msgstr "Dopominanje z budźenjem"

msgid ""
"The weather service estimated the location from your public IP address. Your "
"own address in Contacts provides a more precise location."
msgstr ""
"Wjedrowa słužba je městno z wašeje zjawneje IP-adresy wotměniła. Waša "
"swójska adresa w Kontaktach dawa dokładniše městno."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The weather service is unavailable. Is there an internet connection? (%s)"
msgstr "Wjedrowa słužba k dispoziciji njeje. Je internetny zwisk? (%s)"

#, python-format
msgid "The weather service rejected the request (error %s)."
msgstr "Wjedrowa słužba naprašowanje wotpokaza (zmylk %s)."

msgid "The weather service returned no forecast."
msgstr "Wjedrowa słužba žanu předpowědź njewróći."

msgid "The weather service returned too much data."
msgstr "Wjedrowa słužba je přewjele datow wróćiła."

msgid "The weather service returned unreadable data."
msgstr "Wjedrowa słužba je nječitajomne daty wróćiła."

msgid ""
"The year calendar shows all twelve months; the month calendar provides more "
"room for entries."
msgstr ""
"Lětna protyka pokazuje wšě dwanaće měsacow; měsačna protyka dawa wjace "
"městna za zapiski."

msgid "The year is invalid."
msgstr "Lěto je njepłaćiwe."

msgid "There are no entries to export yet."
msgstr "Hišće žane zapiski za eksport njejsu."

msgid "There are no entries."
msgstr "Žane zapiski njejsu."

msgid "There are no holidays in the organizer for this selection yet."
msgstr "Za tutón wuběr hišće žane swjate dny w organizatorje njejsu."

msgid "There are no saved entries on this page."
msgstr "Na tutej stronje žane składowane zapiski njejsu."

msgid "There is no notebook in this group yet."
msgstr "W tutej skupinje hišće žadyn noticnik njeje."

msgid ""
"There is nothing scheduled in this period.\n"
"Click a day on the left to add an appointment."
